      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<section class=\"secret\">\n<p>A basilisk that starts its turn within 120 feet of a rooster must make a DC 20 Wisdom saving throw or become frightened of the rooster for 1 minute. The basilisk can repeat this saving throw at the end of each of its turns, ending this effect on a success. If the basilisk hears the crow of a rooster it must succeed on a DC 25 Constituion saving throw or drop to 0 hit points.</p>\n</section>\n<p>A basilisk that starts its turn within 120 feet of a rooster must make a Wisdome saving throw.</p>",
